error[E0277]: Z0122: `f32` is not a supported contract type
  --> tests/ui/z0122_unsupported_argument.rs:10:32
   |
10 |     pub fn f(ctx: &mut Ctx, x: f32) {}
   |                                ^^^ the trait `Codec<'static>` is not implemented for `f32`
   |
   = note: fix: use u8..u128, i8..i128, bool, U256, [u8; N] with N in 1..=32, Hash32, Caller, ContractId, CodeHash, AssetId, L1Address, &[u8] or &str
   = help: the following other types implement trait `Codec<'a>`:
             i128
             i16
             i32
             i64
             i8
             u128
             u16
             u32
           and $N others
